  "name": "Pluggable storage backend behind a repo interface",
  "slug": "pluggable-storage-backend-behind-a",
  "spec": {
    "summary": "Extract a storage-backend interface at the repo boundary sized to what commands actually need. Flatfile driver = current code refactored behind it. config.yaml selects the backend (default flatfile). Ship a documented remote wire contract plus a stub remote driver so a future Cloudflare worker can implement the server side. Includes event sharding, lock simplification, and unifying the effective-overlay fold.",
